aced  by an orange admiral as well  and so under the assumption that this is  gonna be kobe this would make him the  orange  what exactly and you may or may not  believe me but there actually is a  pretty clear pattern to the animal theme  within the admirals as well as a  one-piece fan you're already familiar  with the legend of momotaro from my  video momonosuke but in case you forgot  here's a quick refresher basically it's  an old japanese story about a boy who on  his journey to defeat an oni meets a  pheasant a dog a monkey and then in the  second phase of the story a tiger and  later on a bull during the second part  the monkey picks up and plays with a  crab that then goes on to defend itself  so the dog jumps in and tries to kill  the crab but fails to instead it can  only throw the crab with its mouth and  knock it unconscious later on this crab  or another one comes back and attacks  the dog during the final phases of the  story of momotaro now for full  disclosure this is only one of the many  variants of the story that exists that  is however particularly prominent in the  south of japan where oda is also from  the order in which each animal appears  corresponds perfectly with that of each  admiral in the story so once we have met  admiral greenball i believe we will meet  admiral orangecrap who is gonna be none  other than kobe himself sounds way more  reasonable than orange crab should am i  right i feel the exact same way but it  all seems to fit really nicely a bit too  nicely almost the two conflicts between  the dog and the crap might tell us more  about this let's just go back to this  scene here for a moment  kobe steps up to a kind of a clear clash  in morals and codes of justice a kind  who tries to kill kobe but fails in the  end only knocking him unconscious just  like the crap as shanks is stepping in  who uses his shell his haki to defend  against akainu's logia abilities a bit  too much coincidence don't you think and  this would also foreshadow a rematch  between kobe and akainu this time on the  same level now what we still need to  figure out is what ability kobe might  have that would coincide with the orange  theme i mean if kobe becomes an admiral  he needs a devil fruit to back it up  there are probably more options out  there but the best one that comes to  mind is subscribing to my channel for  next generation anime contents and the  second best is asus miramira no me that  is as orange as it gets ace even has a  direct connection to a kainu lake as  direct as it gets  now the only problem with this is  obviously that sabo has already eaten  asus fruit sabo who fights with claws  just as a crap  now if only there was any sign that sabo  might not survive and lose his fruit  ability to someone else  the reverie really turned that idea on  its head for me if sabo now was in  comparable trouble to ace that might  lead to his death or who knows maybe he  already has died then who better for  luffy to inherit both of his brother's  wills than kobe but hey that's just a  theory a one-piece theory and if you do  want to know why kobe could actually  inherit asus and sabo's will by eating  their devil fruit i strongly recommend  you watch exactly that video right here

